      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"Strategic repositioning\" is a bit vague. I've heard reports of specific logistics hubs being activated and increased communications blackouts in the sector. If those are linked to actual combat readiness, wouldn't characterizing it as merely \"ambiguous\" be a major oversight on our part? Be honest with me—is there anything in the classified feeds that contradicts the idea that this is just posturing?",
